{"title":"CSS Skin Compilation/Contest Styles/Annoying Contest","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CSS_Skin_Compilation&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"CSS Skin Compilation (page does not exist)\">CSS Skin Compilation</a>\n<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CSS_Skin_Compilation/Contest_Styles\" title=\"CSS Skin Compilation/Contest Styles\">Contest Styles</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Some_basic_info\">Some basic info</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CSS_Skin_Compilation/Contest_Styles/Annoying_Contest&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Some basic info\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>This competition was started by <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=User:AkshajK&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"User:AkshajK (page does not exist)\">AkshajK</a> on August 23rd, 2011.\n</p><p>The theme was to create the most annoying theme ever.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"The_Styles\">The Styles</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CSS_Skin_Compilation/Contest_Styles/Annoying_Contest&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: The Styles\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>&lt;url&gt;viewtopic.php?f=624&amp;t=436792 Annoying CSS by AkshajK&lt;/url&gt;</li>\n<li>&lt;url&gt;viewtopic.php?f=624&amp;t=436790 Annoyances by asf&lt;/url&gt;</li>\n<li>&lt;url&gt;viewtopic.php?f=624&amp;t=436791 Annoyances 2 by asf&lt;/url&gt;</li>\n<li>&lt;url&gt;viewtopic.php?p=2424887#p2424887 Annoying Melt by PythonNut&lt;/url&gt;</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018075444\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.007 seconds\nR